  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut sweet potato and carrot into bite-sized chunks.\n• Place veggies on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil and season with a pinch of salt and pepper.\n• Toss to coat, then bake until tender, 20-25 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6728203e16186c0f34b4f65a-65894846.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the veggies are roasting, finely chop brown onion.\n• Drain and rinse chickpeas (see ingredients).",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6728203e16186c0f34b4f65a-039ef21d.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a medium saucepan over medium-high heat.\n• Add the water and risoni. Bring to the boil, then reduce the heat to medium and simmer, stirring occasionally, for 7-8 minutes, or until the risoni is 'al dente' and the water has absorbed. TIP: Add a splash more water if the risoni looks dry! TIP: 'Al dente' pasta is cooked through but still slightly firm in the centre.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6728203e16186c0f34b4f65a-1996976f.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the veggies have 10 minutes left, heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat. Cook onion, tossing, until softened, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add chickpeas, diced tomatoes with onion & garlic, the brown sugar and a splash of water and cook until slightly thickened, 4-5 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6728203e16186c0f34b4f65a-20a3f16a.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To the frying pan, add the butter, basil pesto, roasted veggies and baby spinach leaves. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6728203e16186c0f34b4f65a-d9945343.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide risoni between bowls and top with pesto chickpea and veggie stew.\n• Sprinkle with Parmesan cheese and pine nuts.\n• Tear over parsley to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6728203e16186c0f34b4f65a-d2325d78.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
